{
  "declaredLength": 6392,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te l’ho già detto! Il problema di stato per\neccellenza è l’<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>avvelenamento<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fa scendere i PS un po’ alla volta e porta dritti\nalla vittoria! Tutta tattica!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No! La <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>paralisi <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>è senza dubbio superiore!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00210020004C0061002000100002FF0000060070006100720061006C006900730069002000100002FF00000000E8002000730065006E007A0061002000640075006200620069006F0020007300750070006500720069006F007200650021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Se un Pokémon è paralizzato, i suoi movimenti\nsono rallentati!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006500200075006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000E800200070006100720061006C0069007A007A00610074006F002C00200069002000730075006F00690020006D006F00760069006D0065006E00740069000A0073006F006E006F002000720061006C006C0065006E00740061007400690021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tale condizione di spossatezza permette di\nattaccare subito e riportare un’elegante vittoria!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ehi, tu, scusa! Arrivi al momento giusto.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500680069002C002000740075002C0020007300630075007300610021002000410072007200690076006900200061006C0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F002000670069007500730074006F002E001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Avvelenamento o paralisi? Facci capire quale\nè meglio.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007600760065006C0065006E0061006D0065006E0074006F0020006F00200070006100720061006C006900730069003F00200046006100630063006900200063006100700069007200650020007100750061006C0065000A00E80020006D00650067006C0069006F002E001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In altre parole, lotterebbe con noi? Comincio io!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006E00200061006C0074007200650020007000610072006F006C0065002C0020006C006F0074007400650072006500620062006500200063006F006E0020006E006F0069003F00200043006F006D0069006E00630069006F00200069006F0021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Avvelenamento o paralisi? Sarebbe così gentile\nda aiutarci a capire quale dei due è meglio?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La mia tattica si basa tutta sulla paralisi!\nSuvvia, cominciamo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00610020006D006900610020007400610074007400690063006100200073006900200062006100730061002000740075007400740061002000730075006C006C006100200070006100720061006C0069007300690021000A005300750076007600690061002C00200063006F006D0069006E006300690061006D006F0021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sono pront<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F006E006F002000700072006F006E007400100003110000FF0101006F006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, grazie",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002C0020006700720061007A006900650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, cielo! La mia tattica la spaventa?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C0020006300690065006C006F00210020004C00610020006D00690061002000740061007400740069006300610020006C0061002000730070006100760065006E00740061003F001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un Pokémon paralizzato si muove senz’altro\npiù lentamente!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200070006100720061006C0069007A007A00610074006F0020007300690020006D0075006F00760065002000730065006E007A20190061006C00740072006F000A0070006900F90020006C0065006E00740061006D0065006E007400650021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "E visto che si trova in difficoltà, basterà attaccare\ndifilato per concludere in bellezza!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La tattica basata sull’avvelenamento è la migliore,\nma non mi dispiace lottare per seconda.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Una sconfitta totale...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0061002000730063006F006E0066006900740074006100200074006F00740061006C0065002E002E002E001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, dimenticavo! Non si guarisce dalla paralisi\ndopo la lotta!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002C002000640069006D0065006E00740069006300610076006F00210020004E006F006E002000730069002000670075006100720069007300630065002000640061006C006C006100200070006100720061006C006900730069000A0064006F0070006F0020006C00610020006C006F0074007400610021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Se i suoi Pokémon sono paralizzati, le consiglio di\ncurarli con un Antiparalisi!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hai battuto la strategia basata sulla paralisi...\nVedo che sai il fatto tuo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ma adesso tocca a me! Consumerò le energie dei\ntuoi Pokémon un po’ alla volta!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Entra in scena l’avvelenamento! Sei pront<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa\na lottare?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E00740072006100200069006E0020007300630065006E00610020006C20190061007600760065006C0065006E0061006D0065006E0074006F00210020005300650069002000700072006F006E007400100003110000FF0101006F0061000A00610020006C006F00740074006100720065003F001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sì, lottiamo!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300EC002C0020006C006F0074007400690061006D006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, grazie",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002C0020006700720061007A006900650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ti sei impaurit<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa di fronte alla potenza del veleno?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540069002000730065006900200069006D00700061007500720069007400100003110000FF0101006F0061002000640069002000660072006F006E0074006500200061006C006C006100200070006F00740065006E007A0061002000640065006C002000760065006C0065006E006F003F001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un Pokémon avvelenato continua a subire danni\nun po’ alla volta.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200061007600760065006C0065006E00610074006F00200063006F006E00740069006E00750061002000610020007300750062006900720065002000640061006E006E0069000A0075006E00200070006F201900200061006C006C006100200076006F006C00740061002E001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "È una cosa tremenda, e adesso avrai modo di\ncapire che cosa voglio dire!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Se un Pokémon rimane paralizzato, lo curi subito\ncon un Antiparalisi!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006500200075006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000720069006D0061006E006500200070006100720061006C0069007A007A00610074006F002C0020006C006F00200063007500720069002000730075006200690074006F000A0063006F006E00200075006E00200041006E007400690070006100720061006C0069007300690021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\"",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00220000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non solo Lisy, a quanto pare ho perso perfino io...!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F006E00200073006F006C006F0020004C006900730079002C002000610020007100750061006E0074006F0020007000610072006500200068006F00200070006500720073006F002000700065007200660069006E006F00200069006F002E002E002E0021001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Rispondimi sinceramente: cosa è stato più\ndifficile affrontare? L’avvelenamento o la paralisi?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La paralisi!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006100200070006100720061006C00690073006900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "L’avvelenamento!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C20190061007600760065006C0065006E0061006D0065006E0074006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nessun problema con entrambi!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E0065007300730075006E002000700072006F0062006C0065006D006100200063006F006E00200065006E007400720061006D0062006900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cosa?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F00730061003F0021001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Visto? È stato più arduo lottare contro chi usa\nla paralisi!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 4540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006900730074006F003F002000C800200073007400610074006F00200070006900F900200061007200640075006F0020006C006F0074007400610072006500200063006F006E00740072006F00200063006800690020007500730061000A006C006100200070006100720061006C0069007300690021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Davvero?! B-beh, ovvio!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 4672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400610076007600650072006F003F002100200042002D006200650068002C0020006F007600760069006F0021001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Insomma! La paralisi non è da meno!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 4728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006E0073006F006D006D006100210020004C006100200070006100720061006C0069007300690020006E006F006E002000E80020006400610020006D0065006E006F0021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cooosa?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 4808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006F006F00730061003F0021001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vuole dire che i problemi di stato non le creano\nla minima difficoltà?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 4836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Né io né Velenda siamo riuscite a vincere, quindi\ncapisco che non ci sia differenza tra di noi.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 4988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ne abbiamo ancora di strada da fare...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 5188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E0065002000610062006200690061006D006F00200061006E0063006F00720061002000640069002000730074007200610064006100200064006100200066006100720065002E002E002E001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ci sono così tanti altri problemi di stato... Devo\nperfezionare una vasta gamma di mosse!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 5276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Se i suoi Pokémon sono ancora affetti da problemi\ndi stato, abbia la solerzia di usare una Cura totale.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
